{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>ויקחהו</b> is written defective (without) vav — only one took him, and that is Shimon. Therefore, \"and he took Shimon from among them.\"" "<b>רק</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other, כי לא דבר רק הוא. The pit was not empty, for it contained snakes and scorpions. \"Water it did not have, but it did have snakes and scorpions.\" Furthermore, we derive \"it did not have water\" here from where it is written נחש שרף ועקרב וצמאון אשר אין מים."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:54.760003285Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}